      {
        "id": "tb-null-source",
        "moduleId": "null-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "空值的产生",
        "markdown": "空值可以在以下情况中产生：插入元组时某些属性未赋值（例如 `INSERT INTO SC(Sno,Cno) VALUES('201215126','1')`，Grade 自动为空）；显式将某列设为 NULL（例如 `UPDATE Student SET Sdept=NULL WHERE Sno='201215200'`）；外连接也会产生空值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000245"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "空值的产生"
              ],
