            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-null-check",
        "moduleId": "null-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "空值的判断",
        "markdown": "判断一个属性的值是否为空值，不能用普通的比较运算符（如 `= NULL`），而必须用 `IS NULL` 或 `IS NOT NULL`。\n\n[例 3.81] 从 Student 表中找出漏填了数据的学生信息：\n\n```sql\nSELECT *\nFROM Student\nWHERE Sname IS NULL OR Ssex IS NULL OR Sage IS NULL OR Sdept IS NULL;\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000246"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据库标准语言 SQL",
                "空值的判断"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4595,
              "lineEnd": 4606,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "b940d4e4eba85689dae65a86f37bae1a66f7e0e264cb24a51a70dd885150c45d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-null-equality",
        "moduleId": "null-basics",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "为什么不能使用 = NULL",
        "markdown": "在 SQL 中，`expr = NULL` 的结果不是 TRUE 或 FALSE，而是 UNKNOWN。因此 `WHERE col = NULL` 永远不会选中任何行。判断空值必须使用 `IS NULL`，这是初学者最常见的错误之一。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-null-check"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-null-constraint",
        "moduleId": "null-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "空值的约束条件",
        "markdown": "属性定义（或者域定义）中有 NOT NULL 约束条件的不能取空值，加了 UNIQUE 限制的属性不能取空值，码属性不能取空值。",
        "provenance": {
